Deploying core templates only (slim mode). Use --all or MOAI_DISTRIBUTE_ALL=1 for full deploy. Note: builder-harness agent is omitted (see SPEC-V3R4-CATALOG-005 for bootstrap).
Tip: this checkout is shared across concurrent sessions; for branch-changing work (switch/reset/rebase), use a worktree for isolation — `moai cc -w` / `moai glm -w`, or `claude --worktree`. See .claude/rules/moai/workflow/main-checkout-branch-guard.md.
